#
# Minimum line and branch coverage (percent) of src/ on the integration
# branch, used by ci/jobs/coverage.sh instead of ci/coverage-floor when this
# file exists. Only am/release carries it, so it applies once every topic
# branch is merged; each topic branch keeps its own ci/coverage-floor.
# Same rules: raise to the new measured values (rounded down to a whole
# percent) when tests are added, never lower.
